# The cu130 CUDA wheels of the 21 May machine (cuda-*, nvidia-*, triton) are
# omitted: torch 2.5.1+cu121 pins its own CUDA wheels exactly in its metadata.
#
# This file is the input to the resolver; the resolved lockfile for the run
# platform is requirements-lock-linux-cu121.txt. Do not edit one without
# regenerating the other (see environment/README.md).

